    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"There is nothing more fulfilling than to be in a position to work for the health and wellbeing of the communities you live in,\" says alumna Sobia Idrees, MScN '15, who was recently lauded by the Government of Pakistan's National Command and Operations Centre for her services and contribution towards the \"100 days of Nation's Resolve\" against the COVID-19 pandemic.",
